subject: feat(resilience): provider health endpoint + auto-disable on refresh failures + node model error badge

Phase 4 provider resilience:
- /api/health/providers: per-provider auth status (ok/expired/needs-reauth), lock count, last error; needsAttention list
- Providers page: amber banner listing attention-needed providers with refresh
- tokenRefresh: consecutive refresh-failure counter (refreshFailCount) + auto-disable after 3 + needsReauthReason; reset on success
- ModelSelectModal: red badge when a custom node's /models fails to load
- 4.3/4.4 (TokenRouter revalidation, mimo health check) deferred as user-owned


